<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras BR Jan-Feb net $23.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras BR Jan-Feb net $23.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil products distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of federal oil monopoly Petrobras, released the following January to February net profit.</p>
<p>		     Jan-Feb 1997	    Jan-Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Net		   $23.9 million		 $21.3 million</p>
<p>    Gross Sales	 $1.48 bln		 $1.32 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in U.S. dollars and according to Brazilian Generally Accepted Accounting Principles.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
